            "type": "StartTrackUserOptions"
          }
        ],
        "returns": "Promise<StartTrackUserResult>",
        "tags": [],
        "docs": "Starts watching a circular area. When the device enters or leaves it, the plugin POSTs\na check-in or check-out to `apiEndPoint`, also when the app is in the background or closed.\nCalling it again replaces the previous area. Works the same on iOS and Android.\n\nAsks for location permission if needed. Background tracking needs \"Always\" (iOS) or\n\"Allow all the time\" (Android).",
        "complexTypes": [
          "StartTrackUserResult",
          "StartTrackUserOptions"
        ],
        "slug": "starttrackuser"
      },
